1
00:00:00,256 --> 00:00:03,285
Verify the approved appliance image against its checksum.

2
00:00:03,499 --> 00:00:07,509
Import it as a disk in Prism, create the virtual machine, and connect its

3
00:00:07,595 --> 00:00:09,387
adapter to the management subnet.

4
00:00:09,728 --> 00:00:12,029
Keep the machine powered off while you prepare access.

5
00:00:12,449 --> 00:00:16,481
On Windows, generate an SSH key with the commands on screen.

6
00:00:16,801 --> 00:00:19,831
Copy the full public key line from the dot pub file.

7
00:00:20,129 --> 00:00:22,021
Keep the private key on your workstation.

8
00:00:22,335 --> 00:00:26,900
In guest customization, provision the Z T F admin account and add its public

9
00:00:27,113 --> 00:00:27,604
key.

10
00:00:27,924 --> 00:00:32,020
On a static-only network, arrange a Linux administrator login for the Prism

11
00:00:32,105 --> 00:00:34,353
console if you need to set the address there.

12
00:00:34,639 --> 00:00:38,329
The SSH key example leaves the console password unset.

13
00:00:38,649 --> 00:00:41,394
Keep SSH password authentication disabled.

14
00:00:41,849 --> 00:00:42,809
Now power on.

15
00:00:42,959 --> 00:00:46,615
If you use DHCP, confirm the assigned address.

16
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:52,276
If the subnet has no DHCP, verify the static address set by provisioning, or

17
00:00:52,361 --> 00:00:55,625
sign in through the Prism virtual machine console to set it.

18
00:00:55,945 --> 00:01:00,083
If you have no address and no working console login, ask the provisioning

19
00:01:00,169 --> 00:01:02,828
administrator to supply access before continuing.

20
00:01:03,283 --> 00:01:07,465
For a console-configured static address, identify the correct interface and

21
00:01:07,507 --> 00:01:09,118
back up its Netplan file.

22
00:01:09,448 --> 00:01:13,587
Use the approved IP, prefix, gateway and DNS.

23
00:01:13,886 --> 00:01:17,790
If cloud-init owns the file, make the change at the provisioning source.

24
00:01:18,110 --> 00:01:21,907
Set ownership to root and permissions to six hundred on the file named in the

25
00:01:21,950 --> 00:01:22,513
warning.

26
00:01:22,820 --> 00:01:26,084
Run Netplan generate, then start the trial from the console.

27
00:01:26,362 --> 00:01:27,556
Keep that console open.

28
00:01:27,983 --> 00:01:32,826
Once the IP is active, connect as Z T F admin with the matching private key.

29
00:01:33,103 --> 00:01:35,670
Verify the server fingerprint before accepting it.

30
00:01:35,933 --> 00:01:39,794
At the Linux prompt, run who am I and sudo dash V.

31
00:01:39,987 --> 00:01:44,232
Expect the Z T F admin username and a successful sudo check.

32
00:01:44,552 --> 00:01:48,136
If you are testing a Netplan change, accept it from the console after

33
00:01:48,264 --> 00:01:50,656
verifying the route and SSH access.

34
00:01:51,043 --> 00:01:54,669
If the checks fail, let the trial expire and restore the backup.

35
00:01:55,011 --> 00:01:57,998
Check that both containers are running and that the local health endpoint

36
00:01:58,083 --> 00:01:58,970
reports healthy.

37
00:01:59,303 --> 00:02:03,228
Search the service journal for the first-run password, then check Docker logs

38
00:02:03,313 --> 00:02:04,700
if the journal has no match.

39
00:02:05,020 --> 00:02:09,159
If both logs lack the banner and you have no current web credential, open the

40
00:02:09,201 --> 00:02:11,155
Quick Guide's password reset page.

41
00:02:11,487 --> 00:02:14,985
Run the full command from an interactive Linux session and enter a new

42
00:02:15,028 --> 00:02:16,116
password twice.

43
00:02:16,436 --> 00:02:20,148
If the admin account is missing, preserve the user store and contact the

44
00:02:20,191 --> 00:02:21,203
appliance maintainer.

45
00:02:21,606 --> 00:02:25,595
Open the approved appliance address in your browser and sign in as admin.

46
00:02:25,915 --> 00:02:30,864
If you used the generated password, rotate it under Administration, Users.

47
00:02:31,334 --> 00:02:34,704
Confirm the installed build and record the management address and health

48
00:02:34,832 --> 00:02:35,406
result.
